rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don’t have to find the card if you don’t want to.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can’t be used to prevent damage to your creatures, just to you.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each player (starting with the current player and going in turn order) gets the option to pay when this ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If a player pays {1}, Rhystic Cave does not produce any mana, and is not considered to have been tapped for mana. Things which trigger of the land being tapped for mana will not trigger.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The card’s ability has errata so you can’t activate the ability during casting of a spell or activating of an ability. This prevents you from getting into a position where someone paying {1} could stop you from having enough mana to pay for the spell. If you want to use it pay for a spell or ability, you need to use this card before you start the casting or activating.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each player (starting with the current player and going in turn order) gets the option to pay when this spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Only affects creatures you control when it resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each player (starting with the current player and going in turn order) gets the option to pay when this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each player gets the option to pay when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each player gets the option to pay when the spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Each player gets the option to pay when this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If Dual Nature leaves the battlefield between when it triggers and when a token is put onto the battlefield, that token remains on the battlefield indefinitely. It missed the separate ability which would have exiled the token.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the original creature has any “enters the battlefield” abilities, the copy will also have those.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The token is not considered to have been kicked, even if the creature it’s a copy of was kicked.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If a legendary creature enters the battlefield, the token is put onto the battlefield and then the “legend rule” forces its controller to put either the original or the token into its owner’s graveyard before any player can take any actions.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'If the ability is used twice, it will cause the next two attacks this turn (which only happens if something gives a player two attacks) from the creature to “reflect” back to itself. It will not result in double damage back from a single attack.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It checks if you control an untapped land during resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It counts the untapped lands on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It does give the land a color and creature type, which is unlike most other ways to animate a land.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This can be placed on any land, not just Forests.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It means X different creatures. You can’t give more than one +1/+1 counter to a creature with this spell.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Land are normally colorless, so effects that care about the color of the damage’s source will not find a color.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Must target two different creatures.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature’s controller gets the option to pay when the spell resolves.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The two creatures may have different controllers.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose on announcement which creature is the one that can be paid to prevent the effect. The payment itself is made on resolution (if at all).'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Only affects Squirrels on the battlefield when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Only affects creatures you control when the spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Only affects lands the target player controls when the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The lands do not get a creature type.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The lands retain their abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The ability works even if you sacrifice your last swamp to activate it. It only checks for a swamp on activation.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The card is revealed to all players while it is exiled.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The card may only be cast once. Once it is announced and put on the stack, the card is no longer exiled and the effect of Psychic Theft ends.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can cast the instant or sorcery during the End step after you put the “at the beginning of the end step” trigger on the stack, as long as you do so before that trigger resolves.'}, {'date': '2014-02-01', 'text': 'If you target yourself with this spell, you must reveal your entire hand to the other players just as any other player would.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature’s controller gets the option to pay when the triggered ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature’s controller gets the option to pay when this ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The creature’s controller gets the option to pay when this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The land’s controller gets to activate the ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The mana value of this card is still 8, even if you only pay {B}{B} to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The mana value of this card is still 8, even if you only pay {G}{G} to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The mana value of this card is still 8, even if you only pay {R}{R} to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The mana value of this card is still 8, even if you only pay {U}{U} to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The mana value of this card is still 8, even if you only pay {W}{W} to cast it.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The player gets the option to pay when this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The player gets the option to pay when this triggered ability resolves. This will be after the spell is announced, but before it resolves.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You don’t have to decide whether or not you are drawing until after the player decides whether or not to pay.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The spell’s controller gets the option to pay when the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The spell’s controller gets the option to pay when this ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The spell’s controller gets the option to pay when this spell resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The token creatures’ power and toughness continuously adjust. They are not “locked in” when the spell resolves. This is because the tokens get an ability, rather than simply having their power and toughness set.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This card can’t tap itself to allow itself to attack or block. You have to tap a different creature which is not being declared as an attacker or blocker.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'This counts as gaining or losing life as appropriate.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You can’t choose zero targets. You must choose at least one target.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You choose the color (or artifacts) on resolution.'}]", "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Your lands are tapped as part of the effect, not part of the cost.'}, {'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'A noncreature permanent that turns into a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn’t matter how long the permanent has been a creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2005-08-01', 'text': 'Any Auras already on the creature remain.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'If the card has no mana cost (for instance, if it’s a land), then its converted mana cost is 0. This means no tokens will be created.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'No land controlled by the player will untap during their next untap step. This includes lands which entered the battlefield after Mana Vapors resolved.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-08-01', 'text': 'You may discard any card with the land type Forest, including Snow-covered Forest or non-Basic lands like Tropical Island, Murmuring Bosk, or Stomping Ground. You can even discard a card that is a land in addition to other types, such as Dryad Arbor.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]"]
foreign_names: ["[{'name': 'Abhäuten', 'text': 'Ein Spieler Deiner Wahl wirft eine zufällig bestimmte Karte aus seiner Hand ab. Dann wirft dieser Spieler eine weitere zufällig bestimmte Karte ab, falls er nicht 1 bezahlt.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3bcc97b-24e3-4c06-82b0-efd303d1c3fe'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Desollar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '157ce2ec-89e9-4ce4-b511-4be45af7d527'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ereintement', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe87ee46-dfb2-4e52-ba39-19867fad851f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Flagellare', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fb09a2e-430c-4d9f-b307-bf808e0f5137'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '生皮はぎ', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a69b301-a8dc-4b1d-8c6c-1d32bba88916'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Esfolar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46f5ef8d-c7d2-4344-99d5-46c1fdcf346b'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Abschaffen', 'text': 'Du kannst eine Ebene aus Deiner Hand abwerfen, anstatt die Manakosten von Abschaffen zu bezahlen.\\nZerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung Deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9adb89c0-5809-4e2e-adc6-5128b20f4775'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Abolir', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '535b58eb-f1ac-483b-b828-4eb5dc3a7fbf'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Abolition', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '518fc28d-c020-4fa7-bf10-63586126d5c7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Abolire', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1a44eab-9f38-4410-b798-1e35dd3b2f60'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '廃止', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d8b617c-13ea-4e42-8be1-c868808abe74'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Abolir', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0733ffd-9075-4041-acaa-229ecf448db5'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Alarmschwadron\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Du angegriffen wirst und die Alarmschwadron ungetappt ist, kannst Du alle Kreaturen, die Du kontrollierst, enttappen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Rebell\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'082956b3-13c0-422a-8c08-db8898ce656d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Escuadrón de Diana\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b1a2b8-260e-4c37-88d7-9cc60304b458\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Escouade de réveil\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7905606-30bc-465c-ba6e-c05a38e043a8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Squadra dell\'Adunata", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42025c3f-601e-4d36-929d-6cade43e5cde\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'起床ラッパ隊\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bffd389-af83-42d3-ae17-2b548a8f1224\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Esquadrão da Alvorada\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1c0bd0b-cd46-41be-ae20-8ee7168eaa8d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Alexi Westwindzauberin', 'text': 'X{U}, {T}, wirf zwei Karten aus Deiner Hand ab: Bringe X Kreaturen Deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Spruchwandlerlegende', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99daa817-86d7-4a0f-acce-6076c69ff596'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Alexi, Maga Céfira', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8428c495-e042-4ca9-81d3-66cb95956b0c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Alexie, mage du zéphir', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42f28581-ad2e-43e8-afe5-c6c296fe6592'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Alexi, Maga dello Zefiro', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f08528ca-72d1-4ebd-b5f7-5f6f2b9282fd'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '西風の魔道士アレクシー', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff6cb03e-78f1-4613-a20f-851cd0d65c21'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Alexi, Maga Zefiriana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fde9d9b-a2e5-4388-bff1-45fb5dddd1ed'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Alexis Umhang\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Alexis Umhang immer dann spielen, wenn Du auch einen Spontanzauber spielen könntest.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.\', \'type\': \'Kreaturenverzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fca37395-f99e-429b-9bc3-cd4d986969a0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Capa de Alexi\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'584f3915-93b5-4f01-8d36-1f712f07a0f4\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Manteau d\' Alexie", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97a87dd7-8e32-429f-b51d-afe35746bdbd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Mantello di Alexi\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ce24627-7b9f-4311-88b8-2bb3190766c9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'アレクシーの外套\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'514ab041-47ba-4221-99b1-afb32035f6f1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Manto de Alexi\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed918c76-c72b-4712-8768-1770c277a83f\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Auftragsmagiertreffen', 'text': 'Opfere das Auftragsmagiertreffen, wenn keine Kreaturen im Spiel sind.\\n{2}: Das Auftragsmagiertreffen fügt einer Kreatur Deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Jeder Spieler kann diese Fähigkeit spielen, aber nur dann, wenn er auch eine Hexerei spielen könnte.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2308adbc-48ec-4ffc-98ef-faed3ac04c64'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Asamblea de Magos Supervisores', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba6f99eb-0f5c-4f92-8b40-feb201ed79a1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Conclave des spécimages', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c20fef6-b2cc-4dc0-ab44-e9c9aba61fe3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Adunata di Maghi Specialisti', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07d2b127-d6f0-4866-bb47-5955e6db9efa'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '一芸魔道師の集会', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eebd1f17-4156-49cb-8072-5c165e54af2c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Assembléia de Magos Especialistas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae6e66a8-7e25-4bed-9697-3753f5ed51a1'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Aurenbruch\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Land: Zerstöre eine Verzauberung Deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c95742e5-63bb-4aa8-bbfa-691544f273f1\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Fractura de Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35c5fa8d-87f1-428c-9e89-688df127a12b\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Fracture d\'aura", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b32a2108-cbc0-42b4-9252-fe79e36b434e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Frattura dell\'Aura", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0120f46-95eb-473d-8f0c-cfefb1118d71\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'オーラの破れ目\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09d0064a-cf8d-4cd7-bca7-32d951df41aa\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Ruptura de Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f82517c-6baa-4108-930d-94911ad6fc58\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Ausgrabung', 'text': '1, opfere ein Land: Ziehe eine Karte.\\nJeder Spieler kann diese Fähigkeit spielen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aabcee6c-f70c-47d4-b3de-cdc0e747cbca'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Excavación', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc004625-f9a5-4046-af94-dbfebd5cfad9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Excavation', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '667235db-25ae-4832-beca-04f1eb98c130'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Scavo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5a94e8d-b6f0-432e-ac46-d621ea8359dc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '掘削', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a251a733-9077-4bdb-a208-98c4acd06be1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Escavação', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c44843b6-4797-4d2c-a512-cee6d57cdc83'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Avatar der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn Du 3 Lebenspunkte oder weniger hast, kostet der Avatar der Hoffnung 6 weniger beim Ausspielen.\\nDer Avatar der Hoffnung kann eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'995a12df-e003-4953-82fe-7404fcb92f79\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Avatar de la Esperanza\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'705c4530-043e-48c1-b06f-7c09003f2754\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Avatar de l\'espoir", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41323f0c-da24-4514-82fd-fa2dbf91c966\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Avatar della Speranza\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db3e5c29-ecc6-4e90-a48f-7f74045ca45d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'希望の化身\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40fea606-4e78-4cba-922a-31cb290ce9c8\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Avatar da Esperança\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce737f28-803c-40af-9b57-95ba9464603d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Avatar der Macht', 'text': 'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn ein Gegner mindestens vier Kreaturen mehr als Du kontrollierst, kostet der Avatar der Macht 6 weniger beim Ausspielen', 'type': 'Kreatur — Avatar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a9f907c-0b3e-4958-ae43-908dc45475b1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar del Poder', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f5f778c-96d2-427d-84db-f06bfb079ea8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar de la puissance', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffefccf1-576c-4347-9734-01adae077990'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar della Potenza', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd15f6387-0eb9-4871-9e95-8a661a3765b9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '力の化身', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afb8dc10-0e33-46c2-a14c-d81ed826c815'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar do Poder', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6dae2b23-f178-468b-bb81-1111e783d5a9'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Avatar des Leids', 'text': 'Wenn in allen Friedhöfen zusammen zehn oder mehr Kreaturenkarten sind, kostet der Avatar des Leids 6 weniger beim Ausspielen.\\nDer Avatar des Leids kann nur von schwarzen und Artefaktkreaturen geblockt werden.\\n{T}: Zerstöre eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl. Diese kann nicht regeneriert werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Avatar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef019a2a-c0b8-447b-88c1-ceacff1ca4db'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar de la Miseria', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6033d00a-555a-40b0-aad8-fd58efdd3cc3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar du malheur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b2927b0-702b-4371-b753-fe09798f7646'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar della Disperazione', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80a9812c-79d2-49ba-9e64-779fd6327c6f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '悲哀の化身', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03b5b48b-5b50-4707-bc8b-dcf45e629630'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar da Mágoa', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bedd5065-9fa0-4a1f-83c6-88675f6b3c68'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Avatar des Willens', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn ein Gegner keine Karten auf der Hand hat, kostet der Avatar des Willens 6 weniger beim Ausspielen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Avatar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a050c3ee-52e1-4e0c-b493-c3aa4ff4e6fc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar de la Voluntad', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '699f1f2a-3f7e-4a49-911e-6ed77c754db2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar de la volonté', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72d29ffc-8bab-4931-9132-4c9099b5fc18'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar della Volontà', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e984e4a6-ac0f-4a00-b031-563f9e03874e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '意志の化身', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cb28930-7e34-4876-ad13-46660e6003f0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar da Vontade', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ff2c033-816e-46dd-823e-d67737bfa3a8'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Avatar des Zorns', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn ein Gegner sieben oder mehr Länder kontrolliert, kostet der Avatar des Zorns 6 weniger beim Ausspielen.\\n{R}: Der Avatar des Zorns erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Avatar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f5a0bef-89b6-4839-9efa-9609e7ca4281'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar de la Furia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '742bec14-5bfc-4428-8f01-139f6ebd260c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar de la fureur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49f05743-a2a2-4f76-b0f1-fe06498f87fc'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar della Furia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b92a2069-322d-4452-8662-f3beb63d33f7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '憤怒の化身', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd81862bc-4280-4555-9f28-02abbba9ea5c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Avatar da Fúria', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f406bde0-5b70-4e8e-8a47-f41dfc272bed'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Belebender Wind', 'text': 'Alle Kreaturen, die Du kontrollierst, erhalten +7/+7 bis zum Ende des Zuges.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '952e