ltiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Dorso-di-Rasoio Pigmeo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea6d5800-73eb-4b87-b2c1-48e7723f79c5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ピグミー・レイザーバック', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bc422c7-eb7a-4744-9af0-b79c9864e71a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Javali Pigmeu', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c4ccea50-6df0-40db-8c6e-42563117f69e'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Zwillingsnatur', 'text': 'Immer wenn eine Kreaturenkarte ins Spiel kommt, bringt ihr Beherrscher einen Kreaturen-Spielstein ins Spiel, der eine exakte Kopie dieser Kreatur ist.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreaturenkarte das Spiel verlässt, entferne alle Spielsteine mit demselben Namen wie diese Kreatur ganz aus dem Spiel.\\nWenn die Zwillingsnatur das Spiel verlässt, entferne alle durch sie erzeugte Spielsteine ganz aus dem Spiel.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '80d63a63-0530-4ea6-bd38-1ecb499a9c5f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Naturaleza Dual', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b58b3cc-2acd-4fa9-91bd-1a557fa42102'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nature double', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59044d67-4df7-4a96-b969-2ce42aae8010'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Duplice Natura', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c85ebcd5-d936-43ff-99e2-b4a3ec77a63b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '二重の造物', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7a1cd8f-3751-4a10-bfad-b1cb02011dd5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Natureza Dual', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7d23233-7092-4d70-85ce-f64412da452d'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Überauslastung', 'text': 'Immer wenn ein Spieler eine Kreaturenkarte ins Spiel bringt, bringt dieser Spieler ein Land, das er kontrolliert, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0dfc9bf-e17d-4e83-ba38-c4a102aba494'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sobrecarga', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2dfc0d5a-a969-4a1a-91b6-b12fe677f3f1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Surcharge', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff0785a4-d346-4e12-9552-af6dc379c32c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sovraccarico', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d5b08ab-3232-4083-a49b-64bbbf57ffea'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '重荷', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '104aa118-54b8-486a-ae74-b87b127ae816'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sobrecarregar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4ae9119-deef-48da-8891-057f56bb3deb'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Überdenken', 'text': 'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch Deiner Wahl, falls dessen Beherrscher nicht X bezahlt, wobei X die umgewandelten Manakosten des Zauberspruchs sind.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d13aa17-5032-42b8-b6eb-9cbba2c61f07'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Reconsiderar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6244ca3d-15b0-4755-92e6-d3386047ab42'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Reconsidération', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e043742-f117-4250-b178-7479dbcc072c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ripensamento', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2fa2d7f5-a4ac-41e7-afd0-9d6d1d717689'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '再考', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99f6e72b-998a-46cb-9f7c-07684d6dceb7'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Repensar', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cc0573d-e203-4c6d-91bc-294f72955a48'}, 'multiverseid': None}]"]
printings: ['10E', '2X2', '8ED', '9ED', 'A25', 'ARC', 'CM1', 'CM2', 'CMD', 'CN2', 'DDF', 'DIS', 'DST', 'E01', 'J18', 'J21', 'J22', 'JMP', 'M10', 'MH1', 'MM2', 'MP2', 'PCY', 'PD3', 'PLST', 'PPCY', 'PPRO', 'PRM', 'PZ1', 'SLD', 'TD0', 'TSB', 'UMA', 'VMA', 'WC00', 'WC01', 'WOT']
original_text: ["(Walls can't attack.)\\no3: Destroy Wall of Vipers and target creature it's blocking. Any player may play this ability.", "(Walls can't attack.)\\no4: Return Quicksilver Wall to its owner's hand. Any player may play this ability.", 'Activated abilities on Rebel cards cost an additional "Sacrifice a land" to play.', 'As Heightened Awareness comes into play, discard your hand.\\nAt the beginning of your draw step, draw a card.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player puts the top card of his or her library into his or her graveyard. He or she then puts X 1/1 black Minion creature tokens into play, where X is that card's converted mana cost.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Darba unless you pay o\\nGo\\nG.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Whipstitched Zombie unless you pay o\\nB.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may remove a land card in your graveyard from the game. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "At the end of each player's turn, Citadel of Pain deals X damage to that player, where X is the number of untapped lands he or she controls.", 'At the end of your turn, if you control no untapped lands, draw a card.', 'At the end of your turn, if you control no untapped lands, you gain 2 life.', "Basic lands each player controls can't be the targets of spells or abilities as long as that player controls three or fewer lands.", "Branded Brawlers can't attack if defending player controls an untapped land.\\nBranded Brawlers can't block if you control an untapped land.", 'Celestial Convergence comes into play with seven omen counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, remove an omen counter from Celestial Convergence. If there are no omen counters on Celestial Convergence, the player with the highest life total wins the game. If two or more players are tied for highest life total, the game is a draw.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays o\\nX, where X is its converted mana cost.', 'Creatures you control get +0/+1 until end of turn. They get an additional +0/+2 until end of turn unless any player pays o2.', 'Creatures you control get +7/+7 until end of turn.', "Destroy all creatures you don't control. They can't be regenerated.", "Destroy all enchantments you don't control. Then, if you control an untapped land, destroy all enchantments you control.", 'Destroy target land. Devastate deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Destroy target land. Its controller loses 2 life.', 'Draw three cards. Then, if any player pays o2, discard three cards from your hand.', 'Each player puts a green Elephant creature token into play. Those creatures have "This creature\'s power and toughness are each equal to the number of creature cards in its controller\'s graveyard."', 'Enchanted creature may block any number of creatures.', 'Enchanted land has "oc\\nT: Counter target spell unless its controller pays o1."', 'Enchanted land has "oc\\nT: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn."', 'Enchanted land has "oc\\nT: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn."', 'Enchanted land has "oc\\nT: This land deals 1 damage to each creature and each player."', 'Enchanted land has "oc\\nT: This land deals 1 damage to target creature or player."', "Enchanted land is a 5/6 green Treefolk creature that's still a land.", "Fen Stalker can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures as long as you control no untapped lands.", 'First strike\\no2: Zerapa Minotaur loses first strike until end of turn. Any player may play this ability.', 'Flying, first strike\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Pit Raptor unless you pay o2o\\nBo\\nB.', 'Flying\\nAt the end of your turn, tap all lands you control.', "Flying\\nAttacking doesn't cause Diving Griffin to tap.", 'Flying\\nIf an opponent controls seven or more lands, Avatar of Fury costs o6 less to play.\\noo\\nR Avatar of Fury gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nIf an opponent has no cards in hand, Avatar of Will costs o6 less to play.', 'Flying\\nIf you have 3 life or less, Avatar of Hope costs o6 less to play.\\nAvatar of Hope may block any number of creatures.', 'Flying\\nSacrifice Spiketail Drake: Counter target spell unless its controller pays o3.', 'Flying\\nSacrifice Spiketail Hatchling: Counter target spell unless its controller pays o1.', "Flying\\nSacrifice a land: Return Stormwatch Eagle to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nSacrifice two lands: Jeweled Spirit gains protection from artifacts or from the color of your choice until end of turn.', "Flying\\nWhenever Windscouter attacks or blocks, return it to its owner's hand at end of combat.", 'Flying\\no2: Ribbon Snake loses flying until end of turn. Any player may play this ability.', 'Flying\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice X lands: Put X +1/+1 counters on Copper-Leaf Angel.', 'Flying\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice a land: Search your library for a Mercenary card with converted mana cost 2 or less and put that card into play. Then shuffle your library.', 'Hazy Homunculus is unblockable as long as defending player controls an untapped land.', "Hollow Warrior can't attack or block unless you tap an untapped creature you control. (This cost is paid as attackers or blockers are declared.)", "If there are ten or more creature cards total in all graveyards, Avatar of Woe costs o6 less to play.\\nAvatar of Woe can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.\\noc\\nT: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Inflame deals 2 damage to each creature dealt damage this turn.', "Lands target player controls don't untap during his or her next untap step.", "Look at target player's hand, choose an instant or sorcery card from it, and remove that card from the game. You may play the card as though it were in your hand as long as the card remains removed from the game. At end of turn, if you haven't played the card, return it to its owner's hand.", "Mercenaries don't untap during their controllers' untap steps.", "Mercenary Informer can't be the target of black spells or abilities.\\no2oo\\nW Put target Mercenary card on the bottom of its owner's library.", 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Glittering Lion.\\no3: Until end of turn, Glittering Lion loses "Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Glittering Lion." Any player may play this ability.', 'Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Glittering Lynx.\\no2: Until end of turn, Glittering Lynx loses "Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Glittering Lynx." Any player may play this ability.', 'Protection from white\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Bog Elemental unless you sacrifice a land.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each of X target creatures.', "Rebel Informer can't be the target of white spells or abilities.\\no3: Put target Rebel card on the bottom of its owner's library.", 'Remove target attacking creature from the game unless its controller pays o\\nX.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand. Then return another target creature to its owner's hand unless its controller pays o1.", 'Return two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand unless any player pays o\\nX.', "Rhystic Lightning deals 4 damage to target creature or player unless that creature's controller or that player pays o2. If he or she does, Rhystic Lightning deals 2 damage to the creature or player.", 'Rib Cage Spider may block as though it had flying.', 'Sacrifice Spore Frog: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Sacrifice a land: Coastal Hornclaw gains flying until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice a land: Destroy target enchantment.', 'Sacrifice a land: Fault Riders gets +2/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn. Play this ability only once each turn.', 'Sacrifice a land: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to target creature or player this turn.', 'Sacrifice a land: Trenching Steed gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice two lands: Return Coffin Puppets to play. Play this ability only during your upkeep, only if Coffin Puppets is in your graveyard, and only if you control a swamp.', 'Scoria Cat gets +3/+3 as long as you control no untapped lands.', "Search target player's library for up to seven cards and remove them from the game. Then that player shuffles his or her library.", 'Searing Wind deals 10 damage to target creature or player.', 'Shuffle your graveyard. An opponent chooses a card from it at random. If that card is a creature card, put it into play. Otherwise, remove it from the game.', 'Spitting Spider may block as though it had flying.\\nSacrifice a land: Spitting Spider deals 1 damage to each creature with flying.', 'Spur Grappler gets +2/+1 as long as you control no untapped lands.', 'Swampwalk (This creature is unblockable as long as defending player controls a swamp.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Another target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. That creature gets an additional +4/+4 until end of turn unless any player pays o2.', 'Target player discards a card at random from his or her hand. Then that player discards another card at random from his or her hand unless he or she pays o1.', "Target player's life total becomes 20.", 'Target unblocked creature deals combat damage to its controller instead of to you this turn.', 'Trample', 'Trample\\nIf an opponent controls at least four more creatures than you, Avatar of Might costs o6 less to play.', "Trample\\nKeldon Battlewagon can't block.\\nWhen Keldon Battlewagon attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat.\\nTap an untapped creature you control: Keldon Battlewagon gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the tapped creature's power.", 'Trample\\no3: Vintara Elephant loses trample until end of turn. Any player may play this ability.', 'Unless any player pays o2, search your library for a card, put that card into your hand, then shuffle your library.', 'Unless target player pays o3, he or she loses 5 life and you gain 5 life.', "Up to three target creatures can't block this turn.", "Veteran Brawlers can't attack if defending player controls an untapped land.\\nVeteran Brawlers can't block if you control an untapped land.", "Vintara Snapper can't be the target of spells or abilities as long as you control no untapped lands.", 'When Gulf Squid comes into play, tap all lands target player controls.', 'When Keldon Firebombers comes into play, each player sacrifices all lands he or she controls except for three.', 'When Silt Crawler comes into play, tap all lands you control.', 'When there are no creatures in play, sacrifice Task Mage Assembly.\\no2: Task Mage Assembly deals 1 damage to target creature. Any player may play this ability but only any time he or she could play a sorcery.', "Whenever Death Charmer deals combat damage to a creature, that creature's controller loses 2 life unless he or she pays o2.", 'Whenever Fickle Efreet attacks or blocks, flip a coin at end of combat. If you lose the flip, an opponent gains control of Fickle Efreet.', 'Whenever Keldon Berserker attacks, if you control no untapped lands, it gets +3/+0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Lesser Gargadon attacks or blocks, sacrifice a land.', 'Whenever Plague Fiend deals combat damage to a creature, destroy that creature unless its controller pays o2.', "Whenever Shrouded Serpent attacks, defending player may pay o4. If he or she doesn't, Shrouded Serpent is unblockable this turn.", "Whenever Soul Charmer deals combat damage to a creature, you gain 2 life unless that creature's controller pays o2.", 'Whenever Thresher Beast becomes blocked, defending player sacrifices a land.', "Whenever a creature card comes into play, its controller puts a creature token into play that's a copy of that creature.\\nWhenever a creature card leaves play, remove all tokens with the same name as that creature from the game.\\nWhen Dual Nature leaves play, remove all tokens created with it from the game.", "Whenever a player puts a creature card into play, that player returns a land he or she controls to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever an opponent plays a spell, you may draw a card unless that player pays o1.', "Whenever you're attacked, if Reveille Squad is untapped, you may untap all creatures you control.", 'Wing Storm deals X damage to each player, where X is twice the number of creatures with flying that player controls.', 'Wintermoon Mesa comes into play tapped.\\noc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\no2, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Wintermoon Mesa: Tap two target lands.', "You can't untap more than one land during your untap step.", "You may discard a forest from your hand instead of paying Snag's mana cost.\\nPrevent all combat damage that would be dealt by unblocked creatures this turn.", "You may discard a mountain from your hand instead of paying Flameshot's mana cost.\\nFlameshot deals 3 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures.", "You may discard a plains from your hand instead of paying Abolish's mana cost.\\nDestroy target artifact or enchantment.", "You may discard a swamp from your hand instead of paying Outbreak's mana cost.\\nChoose a creature type. All creatures of that type get -1/-1 until end of turn.", "You may discard an island and another card from your hand instead of paying Foil's mana cost.\\nCounter target spell.", "You may play Alexi's Cloak any time you could play an instant.\\nEnchanted creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.", "You may play Greel's Caress any time you could play an instant.\\nEnchanted creature gets -3/-0.", "You may play Jolrael's Favor any time you could play an instant.\\no1oo\\nG Regenerate enchanted creature.", "You may play Latulla's Orders any time you could play an instant.\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to defending player, you may have it destroy target artifact that player controls.", "You may play Mageta's Boon any time you could play an instant.\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+2.", 'o0: Tap all lands you control. Chimeric Idol becomes a 3/3 artifact creature until end of turn.', 'o1, Sacrifice a land: Draw a card. Any player may play this ability.', 'o1, Sacrifice two lands: Destroy target land.', 'o1: Any player may pay o1. If no one does, the next time a source of your choice would deal damage to you this turn, prevent that damage.', 'o1o\\nB, Sacrifice a land: Target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'o1o\\nG, Sacrifice a land: Put two 1/1 green Squirrel creature tokens into play.\\no1o\\nG, Sacrifice a land: All Squirrels get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'o2: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn. Any player may play this ability.', 'o2o\\nG, oc\\nT, Discard two cards from your hand: Until end of turn, all lands target player controls are 3/3 creatures that are still lands.', "o2o\\nWo\\nW, oc\\nT, Discard two cards from your hand: Destroy all creatures except for Mageta the Lion. Those creatures can't be regenerated.", 'o2oo\\nW The next time target attacking creature would deal combat damage to Shield Dancer this turn, that creature deals that damage to itself instead.', "o4: Return target creature card from a graveyard to its owner's hand. Any player may play this ability but only any time he or she could play a sorcery.", 'o\\nWoo\\nW Target attacking creature gets -1/-0 until end of turn.', 'o\\nXo\\nB, oc\\nT, Discard two cards from your hand: Target player discards X cards at random from his or her hand.', 'o\\nXo\\nR, oc\\nT, Discard two cards from your hand: Latulla, Keldon Overseer deals X damage to target creature or player.', "o\\nXo\\nU, oc\\nT, Discard two cards from your hand: Return X target creatures to their owners' hands.", 'oc\\nT, Sacrifice Mine Bearer: Destroy target attacking creature.', 'oc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool unless any player pays o1.', 'oo\\nB Nakaya Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn unless any player pays o2.', 'oo\\nB Regenerate Chilling Apparition.\\nWhenever Chilling Apparition deals combat damage to a player, that player discards a card from his or her hand.', 'oo\\nR Ridgeline Rager gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'oo\\nR Target creature gains haste until end of turn. (It may attack and oc\\nT the turn it comes under your control.)', 'oo\\nU Tap target creature unless its controller pays o1.']
